  "body": "RWC is proud to present 6 Napier Avenue, Takapuna, an exceptional opportunity to secure a substantial 920 m2 landholding in one of the North Shore's most sought-after locations. Proudly built by the current owner, this home is being offered to the market for the very first time, presenting a rare opportunity to secure a property with a unique ownership history.\r\n\r\nOpportunities of this nature are incredibly rare, with substantial parcels of well-positioned land becoming increasingly difficult to secure. Boasting approximately 20.1 metres of road frontage, an impressive 45.7 metres of site depth and an almost completely flat contour, this is a property that demands attention from developers, land bankers, investors and astute buyers alike.\r\n\r\nCurrently zoned Mixed Housing Urban (MHU), the site offers an appealing combination of scale, configuration and location, providing an excellent foundation from which to explore future development potential, subject to planning requirements, resource consents and due diligence.\r\n\r\nAdding another layer of intrigue is the potential for the site to be rezoned to Terrace Housing and Apartment Buildings (THAB) under Proposed Plan Change 120 (PC120). While this remains pending and is subject to the relevant planning process, the possibility presents an additional consideration for purchasers with a long-term vision.\r\n\r\nPositioned in established Takapuna, the property enjoys proximity to an enviable selection of lifestyle amenities, including Takapuna Beach, Shore City, cafés, restaurants, public transport and convenient connections to the Northern Motorway. With a collective of supermarkets also nearby, everyday convenience is well catered for, adding further appeal for future residents and supporting the site's overall location offering.\r\n\r\nFor developers searching for their next project, land bankers looking to secure a strategic holding, or investors seeking a scarce land asset with future potential, 6 Napier Avenue represents a compelling opportunity to secure a substantial parcel in a premium location.\r\n\r\nLandholdings of this calibre are not easily replaced. With its first-ever appearance on the market, substantial scale and strategic positioning, 6 Napier Avenue is an opportunity that deserves serious consideration.\r\n\r\n6 Napier Avenue, Takapuna is being offered for sale by Deadline Private Treaty, closing 3pm on Thursday 19th November 2026 (unless sold prior). All offers are to be submitted in writing by the closing date.\r\n\r\nFor further information or to arrange a site inspection, contact: \r\nTristan Swart - 021 175 8451\r\nMatthew Warden - 022 044 7908",
